    "preamble": "Smt Kamlesh Devi And 3 Others vs State Of U.P. And Another on 23 September, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:155534 Court No. - 80 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 27108 of 2024 Applicant :- Smt Kamlesh Devi And 3 Others Opposite Party :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Applicant :- Parvesh Kumar Pandey,Sarvesh Kumar Pandey Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Vinod Diwakar,J. 1. Heard learned counsel for the applicants and learned A.G.A. for the State. 2. The present application under Section 482 Cr.P.C., has been filed for quashing the Non Bailable Warrant order dated 16.05.2022, passed by the learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Varanasi in Criminal Case No. 765 of 2010, titled as State v. Kamlesh and others, arising out of case crime no. 104 of 1998, under Sections 420, 272 IPC and Section 25, 52, 64, 69 Forest (Conservation) Act, 1980, Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954, registered at P.S. Adampur, District Varanasi. 3.",
